This directory is a modified copy of the gpui_wgpu crate from Zed v1.28.1
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed, crates/gpui_wgpu, commit e8bc16ace).
zyuapp changed it in 2026: the manifest stands alone; the renderer draws
backdrop filters, edge fades, radial gradients and layered shadows; text is
drawn greyscale; the system UI font and the generic family names resolve
as Chromium's Linux build resolves them, through fontconfig.
